+"Group (optional)": "分组（可选）",
+"Has its own program code, run in a protected sandbox. It never needs a build.": "自带程序代码，在受保护的沙箱里运行。永远不需要构建。",
+"Has its own program code. It runs inside your game and is built on this computer, so it needs your permission first.": "自带程序代码，跑在游戏里，而且要在这台电脑上编译，所以得先经你同意。",
+"Horizon can send a few things to its developers. {opening} Settings can change any of it at any time.": "Horizon 可以向开发者发送少量数据。{opening}这些随时都能在「设置」里改。",
+"Horizon couldn't reach the internet. Check your connection, then try again.": "Horizon 连不上网。检查一下网络，然后重试。",
+"Horizon will first download a compiler ({size}) to build them.": "Horizon 会先下载编译器（{size}）来构建它们。",
+"Horizon's mod policy": "Horizon 的模组策略",
+"Horizon's version list came back empty.": "Horizon 的版本列表是空的。",
+"Host a world for your friends with buttons and no commands. The same program runs on a rented server too.": "点按钮就能给好友开个世界，不用敲命令。同一个程序在租来的服务器上也能跑。",
+"Install a local unsigned developer build. This runs the checkout's build code through cargo run -p xtask -- package. Commit tracked changes and rebuild first. Build horizon-ctl, horizon-prepare and horizon-server beside the game, generate horizon-wasm-std.wasm beside it with cargo run --locked -p cargo-horizon-mod -- wasm-std PATH, and compile exporters into the checkout's exporters folder. Native builds use the saved local source commit, including unpublished commits. Select this base explicitly; automatic updates never replace it.": "安装本地未签名的开发者构建。它会通过 cargo run -p xtask -- package 运行检出的构建代码。请先提交已跟踪的改动并重新构建，在游戏旁边构建 horizon-ctl、horizon-prepare 和 horizon-server，"
+    "用 cargo run --locked -p cargo-horizon-mod -- wasm-std PATH 在旁边生成 horizon-wasm-std.wasm，再把导出器编译到检出的 exporters 文件夹。"
+    "原生构建使用保存下来的本地源码提交（包括未发布的提交）。这个基础版本要你手动选，自动更新永远不会替换它。",
