+"{mod}: its crate root forbids unsafe code, which the launcher's generated library entry needs; use #![deny(unsafe_code)] instead": "{mod}：它的 crate 根禁止 unsafe 代码，而启动器生成的库入口需要它；请改用 #![deny(unsafe_code)]",
